# Project Structure

This repository uses a Next.js-only production app.

```text
apps/
  next-app/   # Production Next.js app
  docs-app/   # Next.js docs app
config/       # Centralized configuration
libs/         # Shared domain logic and utilities
tests/        # API and E2E tests
```

## Rules

- Put business logic in `libs/*` first.
- Put static defaults in `config/*`.
- Keep `apps/next-app/app/api/**/route.ts` thin.
- Use `libs/react-shared` for reusable React components/hooks.
